8a:["$","p",null,{"className":"border-t border-[#E5E7EB] p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#4B5563] md:px-6","children":"The Haramain high-speed railway runs between Madinah and Makkah and is often a good choice for a solo traveller on a fixed schedule. Check current timetables and fares with the operator — we do not publish train times because they change. Choose a private car when you travel as a family or group, carry luggage or need stops that a timetable does not give you."}]
